Subject: [PATCH] ftrace: advance readpos in trace_seq_to_user() by really read bytes
User-Agent: Wanderlust/2.15.6 (Almost Unreal) Emacs/22.3 Mule/5.0 (SAKAKI)
MIME-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI 1.14.6 - "Maruoka")
